=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
issue: 216
title: a pre-commit hook moving from pytest to `just test` is a runner swap
origin: issue #216 H2. v0.6.0 blocks with "no pre-commit hook entry invokes a recognised test runner any more (was: pytest)". The recipe `just test` runs is not read, as a `make test` target is not
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.6.2
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.6.2
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: just test
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
